WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.983
Twelve hamsters, one tiny island,

00:00:02.983 --> 00:00:05.483
and only one gets to stay.

00:00:05.483 --> 00:00:07.667
Hold your dash, charge it up,

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:10.100
then send your rival flying!

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.533
Grab a skill.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:13.483
Boom pushes rivals back,

00:00:13.483 --> 00:00:15.533
Stone helps you take a hit,

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:18.100
and Float carries you over holes.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.467
Each round brings another island.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:22.883
Dodge blasts on Volcano Isle,

00:00:22.883 --> 00:00:24.550
slide across Frost Rink,

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:27.500
and steer clear of comets in Cosmos.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.317
The island's crumbling, so keep
moving!

00:00:30.317 --> 00:00:33.667
Take a breather in Free Roam and
collect stars.

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:36.933
Open a gift and watch the reel slow
down.

00:00:36.933 --> 00:00:38.417
What will you get?

00:00:38.417 --> 00:00:40.000
Mix sixteen hamsters,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.417
twenty-one balls and twenty-three
trails

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:44.133
into your own look.

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:45.583
Hamster Bounce.

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:47.667
Pick your look, take your shot,

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:49.950
and be the last hamster rolling.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:54.000
Play now!
